.idea/
config.toml
*.log
mgbot-google-service.json
config.docker.toml
.env
/tmp
/lavalink/logs/
# Lavalink downloads the plugin version declared in application.yml itself. A committed
# jar only risks a fresh deploy running a stale version alongside the declared one.
/lavalink/plugins/*.jar
/martin-garrix-bot
config.prod.toml

# Timestamped config backups, e.g. from a token rotation. These hold the
# credentials the live config held a moment ago, so an untracked one is exactly
# the file a `git add -A` should not sweep up.
config.toml.bak-*
config.docker.toml.bak-*
config.*.bak-*

# Binaries from `go build ./scripts/...`, which lands them in the repo root.
/backfill-stmpd
/backfill-dates
/dedupe-songs
/link-remix-parents
/rekey-songs
/import-beatport

# Agent scratch worktrees; these are separate git repos and must not be committed.
.claude/
/garrixbot
coverage.out
coverage.html

# The standalone Tailwind CLI, fetched by `make tailwind_install`. Its OUTPUT,
# dashboard/static/app.css, is deliberately committed: it is go:embed-ed, so a
# stray *.css ignore rule would turn the dashboard build into a failure that
# only reproduces on a clean clone.
/bin/

# Dashboard binary from `go build ./cmd/dashboard`.
/garrixdashboard
